WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.736 --> 00:00:06.292
One flip card per course concept: the term in front, the definition behind.

2
00:00:06.292 --> 00:00:16.003
Try to answer before you flip. Recalling before revealing is what makes flashcards work. Guessing first, even wrongly, strengthens the memory.

3
00:00:16.003 --> 00:00:22.609
Filter by week. Before a Knowledge Check, run the cards for that week plus one earlier week.

4
00:00:22.609 --> 00:00:33.185
Work the Self-Check Studio above the cards. It turns the week's readings into a short see-it-for-yourself check, so you test the idea, not just the wording.

5
00:00:33.185 --> 00:00:41.093
Say the definition out loud in your own words. If you can only repeat the card's wording, flip it again tomorrow.

6
00:00:41.093 --> 00:00:43.698
Cards are pure practice.

7
00:00:43.698 --> 00:00:48.516
Where next: Take the week's Knowledge Check and see what stuck.
